        <item>
            <title>2.13.94</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 22:12:09 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>201</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.94</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.94

- Amazon Music in Safari or Chrome is now supported: the overlay follows the track, progress and synced lyrics, with play, pause, next, previous and scrubbing, and cover art at full resolution.
- Amazon do not ship an Apple Silicon build of their desktop app, so the web player is the way to use Amazon Music on a current Mac.
]]></description>
